{"title":"Rasputin","artist":"Boney M.","sourceId":"reference:yyLLCTMBpMbK4Kp87CAP","sourceHash":"d06cb9ff101351adbd4d5bb1910c99a1136b97830255de889725a6691616c941","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":37502840,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":55.74,"end":59.6,"text":"There lived a certain man in Russia long ago","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":59.6,"end":63.17,"text":"He was big and strong, in his eyes a flaming glow","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":63.17,"end":66.82,"text":"Most people looked at him with terror and with fear","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":66.82,"end":71.48,"text":"But to Moscow chicks, he was such a lovely dear","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":71.48,"end":74.53,"text":"He could preach the Bible like a preacher","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":74.53,"end":77.58,"text":"Full of ecstasy and fire","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":77.58,"end":82.21000000000001,"text":"But he also was the kind of teacher","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":82.21000000000001,"end":86.64,"text":"Women would desire","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":86.64,"end":88.33,"text":"Ra-Ra-Rasputin","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":88.33,"end":90.01,"text":"Lover of the Russian queen","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":90.01,"end":93.75999999999999,"text":"There was a cat that really was gone","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":93.75999999999999,"end":95.97,"text":"Ra-Ra-Rasputin","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":95.97,"end":97.75,"text":"Russia's greatest love machine","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":97.75,"end":110.71000000000001,"text":"It was a shame how he carried on","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":110.71000000000001,"end":123.28,"text":"But when his drinking and lusting","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":123.28,"end":125.83,"text":"And his hunger for power became known to more and more people","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":125.83,"end":128.1,"text":"The demands to do something about this outrageous man","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":128.1,"end":129.13,"text":"Became louder and louder","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":129.13,"end":129.93,"text":"\"This man's just got to go\", declared his enemies","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":129.93,"end":130.68,"text":"But the ladies begged, \"Don't you try to do it, please\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":130.68,"end":131.09,"text":"No doubt this Rasputin had lots of hidden charms","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":131.09,"end":131.4,"text":"Though he was a brute, they just fell into his arms","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":131.4,"end":131.72,"text":"Then one night, some men of higher standing","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":131.72,"end":132.13,"text":"Set a trap, they're not to blame","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":132.13,"end":132.43,"text":"\"Come to visit us\", they kept demanding","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":132.43,"end":132.81,"text":"And he really came","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":132.81,"end":133.2,"text":"Ra-Ra-Rasputin","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":133.2,"end":133.56,"text":"Lover of the Russian queen","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":133.56,"end":134.26,"text":"They put some poison into his wine","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":134.26,"end":134.64,"text":"Ra-Ra-Rasputin","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":134.64,"end":135.12,"text":"Russia's greatest love machine","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":135.12,"end":135.47,"text":"He drank it all and said, \"I feel fine\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":135.47,"end":135.72,"text":"Ra-Ra-Rasputin","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":135.72,"end":136.13,"text":"Lover of the Russian queen","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":136.13,"end":136.55,"text":"They didn't quit, they wanted his head","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":136.55,"end":136.84,"text":"Ra-Ra-Rasputin","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":136.84,"end":137.22,"text":"Russia's greatest love machine","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":137.22,"end":137.55,"text":"And so they shot him 'til he was dead","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":137.55,"end":138.19,"text":"Oh, those Russians","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}